[00:00.00] 作曲 : Arijit Singh/Avinash Chouhan/Ed Sheeran/Ilya Salmanzadeh/Johnny McDaid/Mayur Puri/Savan Kotecha
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:00.04] 制作人 : Ed Sheeran/Johnny McDaid/Savan Kotecha
[00:00.09] 作词 : Arijit Singh/Avinash Chouhan/Ed Sheeran/Ilya Salmanzadeh/Johnny McDaid/Mayur Puri/Savan Kotecha
[00:00.13]You're glowin'
[00:00.13]耀眼如你
[00:02.95]You colour and fracture the light
[00:02.95]流光溢彩
[00:06.25]You can't help but shine
[00:06.25]情不自禁 便璀璨绚烂
[00:09.85]And I know that
[00:09.85]我深知
[00:13.12]You carry the world on your back
[00:13.12]你背负着整个世界
[00:16.63]But look at you tonight
[00:16.63]但瞧瞧今晚的你
[00:19.13]
[00:20.76]The lights, your face, your eyes
[00:20.76]灯光映照 你的脸庞 你的眼眸
[00:24.44]Exploding like fireworks in the sky
[00:24.44]如烟火在夜空炽烈绽放
[00:30.29]
[00:30.63]Sapphire
[00:30.63]澄澈如蓝宝石
[00:31.32]Touchin' on your body while you're pushin' on me
[00:31.32]贴近你身躯 指尖游走过曲线
[00:33.90]Don't you end the party, I could do this all week
[00:33.90]别让这场狂欢落幕 我能沉醉整整七天
[00:35.99]We'll be dancin' till the morning, go to bed, we won't sleep
[00:35.99]我们要共舞到破晓 就算躺下也无眠
[00:38.51]ਚਮ-ਚਮ ਚਮਕੇ ਸਿਤਾਰੇ ਵਰਗੀ
[00:38.51]如星辰般闪烁
[00:40.83]Sapphire
[00:40.83]澄澈如蓝宝石
[00:41.79]Touchin' on your body while you're pushin' on me
[00:41.79]贴近你身躯 指尖游走过曲线
